idence_refs": ["task_af73c96d39e6", "observation_e9bac58df9f7"], "explanation": "pg_stat_activity shows the business request (session_372c7fa6286f, pid 1759) active and waiting on Lock/transactionid, blocked by session_a8961bca7237 (pid 1758), which is 'idle in transaction' after running the same UPDATE inventory SET stock=stock-1 WHERE product_id=1 and holds the row/transaction lock while waiting on ClientRead. The blocker is the root of the chain (no further blocking_session_ids). No evidence of large data, index, or vacuum issues: table has 2 live tuples, only the PK index, and the UPDATE is fast (mean 0.05ms). Uncertainty: none material; the fix path is rolling back the eligible idle-in-transaction blocker session per allowed operations, never touching the business request.", "question": null, "waiter_session_id": "session_372c7fa6286f"}, "producer_call": "call_002", "sha256": "fc74bebd83242a1309a34e4fcb35de0edbf19bb832dd1bbfeda09642ed9517f2"}, {"actor": "verifier", "branch": "initial", "created": "2026-11-05T04:33:33.729027+00:00", "id": "verification_evidence_6dc1cbf1b66c", "kind": "verification_evidence", "parents": ["environment_version_96007d167f43"], "payload": {"activity": {"environment_revision": 1, "observed_utc": "2026-11-05T04:33:33.725588+00:00", "query": "pg_stat_activity + pg_blocking_pids; scoped to owned sessions", "rows": [{"application_name": "session_a8961bca7237", "blocking_pids": [], "blocking_session_ids": [], "pid": 1758, "query": "UPDATE inventory SET stock=stock-1 WHERE product_id=1", "session_id": "session_a8961bca7237", "state": "idle in transaction", "wait_event": "ClientRead", "wait_event_type": "Client"}, {"application_name": "session_372c7fa6286f", "blocking_pids": [1758], "blocking_session_ids": ["session_a8961bca7237"], "pid": 1759, "query": "UPDATE inventory SET stock=stock-1 WHERE product_id=1", "session_id": "session_372c7fa6286f", "state": "active", "wait_event": "transactionid", "wait_event_type": "Lock"}, {"application_name